{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI arrived in Luxembourg today and walked through the city and over part of the fortifications with Mr. von Hanfstengel. It was a pleasant walk.\n\nA fellow traveler from Liège, who is returning from a trip along the Rhine, told me of his great sorrow: He lost a son of 21 and a daughter of 17. He invited me to visit him there.\n\nI have booked the diligence to Metz for tomorrow morning. The heat is subsiding, and I look forward to continuing the journey.\n\nYours\nHegel"}}],"created":1795221254,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":120,"prompt_tokens":190,"total_tokens":310,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-0BJQuPqncFzRB4OsLolz6kRTVv2FSw0C","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":190,"prompt_ms":476.776,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.5093473684210528,"prompt_per_second":398.50999211369697,"predicted_n":120,"predicted_ms":2836.73,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.838067226890757,"predicted_per_second":41.94970970095849}}